{
  "note": [
    "The Physical Plant's fabric (DR-106, the mech wing), cut from the one Kalamontee layout in scripts/fabric-kalamontee.mjs -- regenerate from there, do not hand-edit. 16 x 8 x 16 as the Junction's glimpse placed it, concrete. The eye is at [3, 1.6, -4], on the open floor inside the north-east exit: from the middle the glimpse's 5 m machine stands 0.5 m to the north, and further south-east the eye would see up Mech Corridor North and through the Junction's east mouth to the Elevator Lobby's blue door.",
    "The game: \"a huge, dim room with exits in the northeast and southeast corners. The room is criss-crossed with catwalks and is filled with heavy equipment presumably intended to heat and ventilate this complex. Hardly any of the equipment is still operating\" (compone.zil 1434-1437); the catwalks \"are too high for you to access\" (globals.zil 2437-2439). Kept from the glimpse: the two machines and the catwalk over the north-east exit's line. Added: two air handlers on the west wall with ducts into the roof, a main duct along the north wall, two boilers with flues in the south-west, a north-south catwalk at 4 m and an east-west one at 6 m, railed and hung from the roof, no stair to either; a pump; one panel with its lamp lit. The glimpse's two dim roof lamps.",
    "Two 2.4 x 2.8 exits in the east wall, 6.5 m north and 5.66 m south of the middle (the wall cut once and the pier between them put back): north-east, Mech Corridor North's east wall; south-east, down the Mech Corridor to Mech Corridor South's east wall, 25 m out."
  ],
